    <div class="wide hero-grid">
      <div>
        <h1>Educational infrastructure for responsible AI adoption.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Nexus Institute for AI Learning develops and disseminates the competency frameworks, measurement instruments, and implementation models that help community colleges, universities, and workforce organizations adopt artificial intelligence effectively, responsibly, and sustainably.</p>
        <span class="tagline">A nonprofit research and implementation organization registered in the State of Ohio.</span>
